sequenceDiagram
    participant Main as Main Thread
    participant Pool as ThreadPool
    participant Worker1 as Worker Thread 1
    participant Worker2 as Worker Thread 2
    participant Queue as firingQueue
    participant Tree as reachabilityTree
    participant Visited as visitedMarkings

    Note over Main: Initialize analyzer

    Main->>Tree: Add initial marking (m0)
    Main->>Visited: Mark initial marking as visited
    Main->>+Queue: Enqueue initial transition tasks
    
    Main->>+Pool: Create worker threads
    Pool->>+Worker1: Create & start
    Pool->>+Worker2: Create & start
    
    par Workers process tasks in parallel
        loop Until no more tasks
            Worker1->>Queue: Poll for task
            Queue-->>Worker1: Return FiringTask
            
            Worker1->>Tree: Get parent node
            Tree-->>Worker1: Return Node
            
            Worker1->>Worker1: Fire transition in subnet
            
            Worker1->>Tree: Update child node's subnet marking
            Worker1->>Worker1: Decrement completion counter
            
            alt Subnet processing complete
                Worker1->>Visited: Check if marking exists
                
                alt New marking
                    Worker1->>Visited: Add new marking
                    Worker1->>Worker1: Calculate enabled transitions
                    Worker1->>Tree: Add new child nodes
                    Worker1->>+Queue: Enqueue new subnet tasks
                else Duplicate marking
                    Worker1->>Tree: Remove duplicate node
                end
            end
            
            Worker1->>Worker1: Process batched tasks
        end
    and
        loop Until no more tasks
            Worker2->>Queue: Poll for task
            Queue-->>Worker2: Return FiringTask
            
            Worker2->>Tree: Get parent node
            Tree-->>Worker2: Return Node
            
            Worker2->>Worker2: Fire transition in subnet
            
            Worker2->>Tree: Update child node's subnet marking
            Worker2->>Worker2: Decrement completion counter
            
            alt Subnet processing complete
                Worker2->>Visited: Check if marking exists
                
                alt New marking
                    Worker2->>Visited: Add new marking
                    Worker2->>Worker2: Calculate enabled transitions
                    Worker2->>Tree: Add new child nodes
                    Worker2->>+Queue: Enqueue new subnet tasks
                else Duplicate marking
                    Worker2->>Tree: Remove duplicate node
                end
            end
            
            Worker2->>Worker2: Process batched tasks
        end
    end
    
    Note over Worker1, Worker2: Workers detect empty queue
    Worker1-->>-Pool: Worker finished
    Worker2-->>-Pool: Worker finished
    
    Pool-->>-Main: All workers completed
    Main->>Tree: Get final reachability tree
    
    Note over Main, Tree: Analysis complete
